  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "By using the BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2042326d26ec7b593e52bbbdd22d890b59b1e59f92be81a7235509e9af1c4625.png] \n\nChecking the options:\n\n1. 15 + 5 ÷ 1 - 9 × 4 = 70\n\nAfter interchanging the symbols × and -\n\n⇒15 + __**5 ÷ 1**__ × 9 - 4 = 70\n\n⇒15 + __**5 ×**____** 9**__ - 4 = 70\n\n⇒__**15 + 45**__ - 4 = 70\n\n⇒60 - 4 = 70\n\n⇒**56 ****≠ 70**\n\n2. 5 - 6 × 3 + 16 ÷ 4 = 31\n\nAfter interchanging the symbols × and -\n\n⇒5 × 6 - 3 + __**16 ÷ 4**__ = 31\n\n⇒__**5 ×**____** 6**__ - 3 + 4 = 31\n\n⇒__**30 - 3**__ + 4 = 31\n\n⇒27 + 4 = 31\n\n⇒**31 = 31**\n\n3. 11 + 6 × 3 - 8 ÷ 2 = 5\n\nAfter interchanging the symbols × and -\n\n⇒11 + 6 - 3 × __**8 ÷ 2**__ = 5\n\n⇒11 + 6 - __**3 **____**×**____** 4**__ = 5\n\n⇒__**11 + 6**__ - 12 = 5\n\n⇒17 - 12 = 5\n\n⇒5 = 5\n\n4. 15 - 4 × 3 + 6 ÷ 1 = 63\n\nAfter interchanging the symbols × and -\n\n⇒15 × 4 - 3 + __**6 ÷ 1**__ = 63\n\n⇒__**15 **____**× 4 **__- 3 + 6 = 63\n\n⇒__**60 -**____** 3**__ + 6 = 63\n\n⇒57 + 6 = 63\n\n⇒63 = 63\n\nOnly** option 1** is not followed.\n\nHence, the correct answer is __**option 1**__.",
